  STRUCTURE CHECK (J'=1/2 toy: the a.q source coupling at full strength, no MOND shutoff):
    Delta_Phi^0 = 2*(2*pi*G*r*rhob(r) + Phi1 - Psi1)/r  ; Delta_Psi^0 = (4*pi*G*r*rhob(r) + Phi1 - Psi1)/r
    [an O(1) G-renormalization in BOTH channels: with J' ~ O(1) the source coupling renormalizes
     gravity -- the physical model needs J' -> large at large Y so chi' (= Phi'/2J') and all
     chi-sources die in the Newtonian regime. The solar gate quantifies this in agentY_gates.py.]

  THE J = Y/4 POINT: THE SINGULAR SURFACE (recorded as a dead end, caught by the gate)
    eqN|C=0, J=Y/4, on (chi'=2Phi', Psi=Phi): -r**2*rhob(r)   [!= 0: NO solution with
    matter: 0 = 8 pi G rhob. The apparent vanishing of the conditions at J=Y/4 was 0 x infinity.]
    An exact-in-C treatment AT the singular surface (where the C-operators would resolve the
    degeneracy) is logged as an open route, not claimed.

